// CotSC localisation - bg0600_baldurs_gate.d
// English translation reference. Translate the text after each @number.

@1 = ~Something shifty is happening in the Iron Throne building. Can't quite put my finger on it but the silhouette of this massive building itself makes me nauseous.~
@2 = ~I can't say I'm happy that the city of Baldur's Gate is reopened now. Bandit raids won't end as easily. Cuddled up within the walls at least I felt safe. Now, quietest noise of rustling in the bushes makes my skin crawl. Tis a dangerous place to live at.~
@3 = ~If you're a person of culture, visit the Hall of Wonders. This place holds great importance to the history of Baldur's Gate.~
@4 = ~We are just trying to have a private moment. Please leave us be.~
@5 = ~Grokh doesn't like the look of you. You leave Grokh alone.~
@6 = ~I wouldn't advice you to go down to the sewers. Ratchild made it his domain.~
@7 = ~Who is Ratchild?~
@8 = ~An outcast. He and I used to be friends but unfortunately he strayed off a beaten path and chose to create a tribe down in the sewers. His bloodthirsty cravings got the better of him. He formed a tribe and disappeared into the darkness down below. I haven't seen him ever since. I wish he could come to his senses, but I doubt he ever will. It's just not in his style to let go of his own ideals.~
@9 = ~Do yourself a favour and avoid The Undercellar. This place reeks of depravity and baseness. It can be pleasurable… I sampled such pleasures but I was young and foolish. Now I regret it and you shall too. So, don't put yourself in such position.~
@10 = ~I am about to open a bakery in docks. You can see my bakes when the business is running.~
@11 = ~(his eyes tear up) But I do not like violence. I just want people to please me.~
@12 = ~Weeeh! (he starts crying and runs away)~
@13 = ~You're such a disgrace to our race. You should shed your blood on a battlefield, and spoil your hands with blood of your foes, not with flour.~
@14 = ~You are pathetic, boy! I bet your parents aren't proud. If I was your father, I'd discipline you right now for your weakness.~
